slides.prompt:
A high-impact, cinematic title slide that commands immediate authority. A massive, vertical circular segment on the left houses a high-definition photograph of a glowing futuristic city, creating a powerful window into the future. The typography is set in a vibrant, high-contrast yellow that radiates against the deep navy background, balanced by minimalist geometric accents that add a layer of technical sophistication. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": {
    "type": "HorizontalSplit",
    "ratio": "40/60",
    "alignment": "center-y"
  },
  "colors": {
    "bg": "#0F172A",
    "accent": "#FACC15",
    "text_primary": "#FFFFFF",
    "text_secondary": "#FACC15"
  },
  "visual_elements": {
    "left_mask": { "shape": "circle-segment", "size": "110% height", "image": "futuristic_city_night" },
    "background_pattern": { "type": "mesh-gradient", "opacity": "0.1" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "h1": { "size": "64px", "weight": "900", "color": "#FACC15", "case": "uppercase" },
    "subline": { "size": "18px", "weight": "Bold", "color": "#FFFFFF", "tracking": "0.3em" }
  }
}

A sophisticated vision slide that humanizes technical strategy. A large, circular professional portrait is positioned on the left, framed by a thick, glowing yellow border that makes the image pop. The right side is dedicated to a clean, highly legible vision statement, utilizing a refined typographic hierarchy that communicates both warmth and professional rigour. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "SidebarVision",
  "colors": { "bg": "#0F172A", "ring": "#FACC15" },
  "portrait": {
    "size": "340px",
    "border": "8px solid #FACC15",
    "shadow": "0 0 30px rgba(250, 204, 21, 0.3)"
  },
  "typography": {
    "headline": { "size": "42px", "weight": "900", "color": "#FFFFFF" },
    "quote": { "size": "20px", "color": "#94A3B8", "line_height": "1.6", "italic": true }
  }
}

A visually dynamic objective slide that uses light and contrast to focus attention. A massive, glowing yellow circular ring anchors the primary headline on the right. On the left, mission-critical targets are presented in a clean vertical list, each accompanied by a custom technical icon that reinforces the sense of precision and strategic intent. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "FocalRingList",
  "visuals": {
    "main_ring": { "size": "480px", "color": "#FACC15", "thickness": "2px", "glow": true }
  },
  "typography": {
    "numbers": { "size": "24px", "weight": "Black", "color": "#FACC15" },
    "list_text": { "size": "16px", "color": "#FFFFFF", "spacing": "48px" }
  },
  "icons": { "color": "#FACC15", "size": "32px" }
}

A detailed technical slide designed for executive scrutiny. Three vertical circular markers denote core operational values on the right, while the left side provides a deep-dive narrative into technical standards. The layout is clean and rigid, communicating structural reliability and industry-leading performance. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "TechnicalDeepDive",
  "components": [
    { "label": "AGILE", "shape": "circle", "icon": "refresh-cw" },
    { "label": "MONITOR", "shape": "circle", "icon": "activity" },
    { "label": "DEPLOY", "shape": "circle", "icon": "box" }
  ],
  "typography": {
    "text_block": { "size": "15px", "color": "#94A3B8", "max_width": "500px" },
    "header": "Bold 28px #FFFFFF"
  }
}

An impact-driven slide that visualizes industry dominance through bold geometry. A vibrant orange-to-yellow gradient arc sweeps across the canvas, creating a sense of forward momentum. High-contrast headlines are nestled within the arc, creating a powerful emotional peak in the presentation's narrative. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "GradientArcImpact",
  "visuals": {
    "arc": { "from": "#F59E0B", "to": "#FACC15", "thickness": "40px", "radius": "300px" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "headline": { "size": "54px", "weight": "Black", "color": "#FFFFFF", "pos": "relative-to-arc" },
    "stat": { "size": "80px", "color": "#FACC15", "text": "$2B+" }
  }
}

A clean and bold transition slide that resets the viewer's focus. A massive, stylized '1.' graphic in glowing yellow dominates the layout, paired with a high-density summary of the foundational phase. The generous use of dark whitespace creates a sophisticated break in the roadmap. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "TransitionSlide",
  "visuals": {
    "big_number": { "text": "1.", "size": "240px", "weight": "Black", "color": "#FACC15", "opacity": "0.8" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "phase_title": "Bold 32px #FFFFFF",
    "summary": "Regular 14px #94A3B8"
  }
}

A consistent follow-up transition slide that maintains the narrative flow. A large, stylized '2.' in yellow denotes the acceleration phase, maintaining the same typographic scale and sophisticated dark spacing as the previous transition to ensure a logical and professional progression. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "TransitionSlide",
  "visuals": {
    "big_number": { "text": "2.", "size": "240px", "weight": "Black", "color": "#FACC15", "opacity": "0.8" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "phase_title": "Bold 32px #FFFFFF",
    "summary": "Regular 14px #94A3B8"
  }
}

A modern and flexible service overview slide featuring organic, glowing cards. Three distinct bubbles housing business divisions float against the dark navy background, each combining a custom yellow icon with refined typography to suggest an adaptable and high-tech product suite. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "FloatingServiceBubbles",
  "components": [
    { "title": "CLOUD", "icon": "cloud", "glow": "#FACC15" },
    { "title": "SECURITY", "icon": "shield", "glow": "#FACC15" },
    { "title": "ANALYTICS", "icon": "pie-chart", "glow": "#FACC15" }
  ],
  "card_style": {
    "bg": "rgba(255,255,255,0.05)",
    "blur": "10px",
    "border": "1px solid rgba(250,204,21,0.2)"
  }
}

A high-fidelity infrastructure slide that visualizes the company's global reach. Three large, glowing circular nodes are positioned over a dark map, connected by elegant light-trails that represent real-time data flow. The design communicates vast scale and technical reliability. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "GlobalNetworkMap",
  "visuals": {
    "map_bg": "dark_navy_minimalist_world",
    "nodes": { "color": "#FACC15", "pulse": true },
    "connections": { "color": "#FACC15", "opacity": "0.4", "curve": "arc" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "labels": "Bold 12px #FFFFFF",
    "stats": "Medium 10px #94A3B8"
  }
}
